IMPORT prelude
-- SUM-TYPE-FIELDS-SPEC §3 S1: a field that two or more constructors declare
-- with the same name AND the same type is ONE selector, total over the
-- constructors that declare it.
--
-- `name` sits at index 1 on Landlord and at index 0 on Tenant. Fields are
-- stored positionally, so the merged selector has to carry each constructor's
-- own arity and index (spec §5 item 2). This file is the guard against a
-- checker-only merge, under which the LAST arm's one-branch closure wins and
-- the Landlord read below dies at run time.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Landlord HAS addr IS A STRING, name IS A STRING
    Tenant   HAS name IS A STRING, rent IS A NUMBER

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign HAS signer IS AN Actor

theLandlord MEANS Landlord OF "1 Main St", "Ms Ng"
alice       MEANS Tenant OF "Alice", 1500
bob         MEANS Tenant WITH name IS "Bob", rent IS 900
mrNg        MEANS Landlord WITH addr IS "2 High St", name IS "Mr Ng"

-- read on each arm, built positionally and by keyword
#EVAL theLandlord's name
#EVAL alice's name
#EVAL bob's name
#EVAL mrNg's name

-- the merged selector is an ordinary function
#EVAL name theLandlord
#EVAL map name (LIST theLandlord, alice, bob, mrNg)

-- and a reader that takes ANY Actor can project it: the selector's type is
-- FUNCTION FROM Actor TO STRING, not per-arm, so no CONSIDER is needed here.
GIVEN a IS AN Actor
GIVETH A STRING
`who is` a MEANS a's name

#EVAL `who is` theLandlord
#EVAL `who is` alice

-- the fields each arm keeps to itself are untouched
#EVAL theLandlord's addr
#EVAL alice's rent

-- Spec §1.2: the shared field read inside a quantifier's filter, armed and
-- traced. Before S1 this was "multiple definitions for the identifier `name`".
everyone MEANS LIST theLandlord, alice, bob

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`alice signs` MEANS
    EVERY a IN everyone WHO a's name EQUALS "Alice" MUST Sign (EXACTLY a) WITHIN 14

#TRACE `alice signs` AT 0 WITH PARTY alice DOES Sign alice AT 1

-- The filter has to READ the field off every member, landlord included, even
-- when nobody passes it.
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`nobody signs` MEANS
    EVERY a IN everyone WHO a's name EQUALS "Zed" MUST Sign (EXACTLY a) WITHIN 14

#TRACE `nobody signs` AT 0 WITH PARTY alice DOES Sign alice AT 1
